      <li id="src-2">Heinrich, B. (2000). <em>Mind of the Raven</em>. Harper Perennial. — object manipulation and play in ravens.</li>
      <li id="src-3">Bugnyar, T. &amp; Heinrich, B. (2005). Ravens, <em>Corvus corax</em>, differentiate between knowledgeable and ignorant competitors. <em>Proceedings of the Royal Society B</em>, 272, 1641–1646.</li>
